      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "34",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enu nyuza, kundamenu kwakwihi mutiyi; ninenu nyuza yawantu, tiyililenu. Iseki ditiyi, niyuma yalumbamamu; mpata yamunumwishina nawa yitiyi, niyuma yejima yafumaŋamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa Yehova hakutatashanina nyuza yejima, hakulendumukila izaza dawu dejima; nayinoŋeshi dehi ji-i chikupu, nayihani dehi akayŋaholi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awa anajahuwu akayinata chakuyinata, hakakakumuka niivumba dayibimbi yawu datama, nimpidi jakasuŋunuka namashi awu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyileŋaleŋa yamwiwulu yejima yakasuŋunuka nawa, nimawulu akayivuŋa avuŋa chikwamukanda wavuŋa vuŋaŋawu neyi chikaŋa; yileŋaleŋa yawu yejima yakalehuka lehu, neyichalepukaŋa mafu amuvinyu hiyakuhuluka, neyi chalepukaŋa nimafuachikuyu hiyakuhuluka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa mpoku yami yakabali yinanwi dehi mashi mwiwulu, nimpwila ngwa. Tiyenu, yakenza nakukunkumukila hadiEdomi nihadi antu eshiŋu dami, kulonda kusompesha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mpoku yaYehova yakabali yekuta dehi mashi, yanuna dehi namanji, namashi awanyana kanyikoku nampembi, namanji akunshiya jayizamba yanyikoku; muloŋa Yehova wukuketula yimuna muBozira, wukujahola antu amavulu mwituŋa daEdomi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aŋombi amumpata akenza nakukunkumuka nawu nima yoŋa aŋombi amayala nimaboŋu nawa, ituŋa dawu dasheta dehi namashi, nilunkuŋulwawu lwalebama dehi namanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muloŋa lelu hiifuku dakutenda kwaYehova, himwaka wakufuta muloŋa watamishiluwu Ziyona kudi antu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tuloŋa twamuEdomi twakabalumuka wukokotu, nilunkuŋu lwekala mulwaka balumuka kesi kaNzambi, niituŋa dawu dakabalumuka wukokotu wakwata dehi kesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Himwakajimaku niwufuku nimwaana; mwakafwindaŋa wishi niwufuku nimwaana; mwakekala neyi muchihembi hohumufwawa muvwalikawa, mufwawa muvwalikawa; kwosi muntu wakahitamuku chahaya nyaka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dakekala dambala damumpundu nachisaka; mwakashakama chikuŋulu nekololu; wakatanjikahu mwonji wakuchachaŋesha nachu, nilevo wakuleta nachu kubula mwituŋa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akata mbika ayilolu jawu, nawu, Inzenu mudi wanta, hiyakamwekanaku; tulamba twawutwejima anamani dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mumatalawu awanta mwakamena nyiŋa, munyikala yawu yayipaka mwakamena nzonzonzu ninyitondu yalemana; mwakekala mwakushakama nyumbu, chipaŋu chawanyamalanda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anyama amwisaŋi ekala muchibaba akapompelamu nawatuŋawidi, niampembi amwisaŋa akaditambekelamu, mwalala chinsweŋi wakashakama kwenoku, kwokwakawanayi nikwindi kwakunookela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikuŋu wakaalilaku chaala chindi, wakombila nimateta, hakayiteta, hakapompesha anyanindi mumwevulu windi; kwokwakapompela niyiyimbi, iwu naŋodindi, iwu naŋodindi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Keŋkeŋenu mumukanda waYehova mutaŋumu; yumiyi himwakabula chuma nichimuku, kwosi wakabula iŋodinduku, muloŋa kanwa kamikanashimuni dehi, niSpiritu yindi nayipompeshi dehi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 34:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nayisakwili dehi nachinjikijilu chakusakula nachu, chikasa chindi chinayanjaŋeni dehi namwonji; dakekala ituŋa dawu dahaya nyaka, akashakamamu mufwawa muvwalikawa, mufwawa muvwalikawa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.34.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.34.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
